WEBVTT

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.130
What's that on his cheek?

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.410
It's a marker.  You don't know what it is?

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:20.920
Security puts that on everyone they catch.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.570
So this person is a bad guy?

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.000
Didn't the card spirits say that he's fine?

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.330
Yeah.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.490
He's taken very good care of these cards.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.620
So he's fine…  I think…

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.840
I see.  Then that's good enough!

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.580
Who are you?

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:49.010
Don't you remember?  You passed 
out downstairs last night.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.480
I'm Lua.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.200
This is my younger sister Luca.  We're twins.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.150
What's your name?

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:07.770
Yusei.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:34.380
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:39.380
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:47.870
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.880
Break through even further

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:59.380
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:06.550
There's always only one truth

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:10.420
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:15.210
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:21.310
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:56.420
Dial On!  Roar, Morphtronic Deck

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.700
Where am I?

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.410
Our place!

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:09.990
This area is called the Tops, which is 
the highest area in Neo Domino City.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.590
So it was the Tops…

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.170
Why can't you do anything?

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:25.380
I didn't say I can't do anything.

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:31.240
Once again, if City and Satellite 
investigators want to search the Tops residential area,

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:35.240
you must follow official procedures 
and receive permission.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.410
C'mon!

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:41.170
There's a chance that a garbage 
from Satellite sneaked in there!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.670
Like I said, in order to conduct an 
investigation, there are procedures to follow…

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:45.850
I've had enough!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.640
How did it go?

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:51.130
I can't believe that I 
was treated as garbage.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:55.230
Well, even among Security, they 
feel that they're special...

00:03:55.490 --> 00:04:00.220
The people from Tops always got on my nerves!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.260
They're so difficult to work with.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.430
What should we do?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.930
There's no doubt that he went in there.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.890
All we can do is wait and watch.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.630
Yusei, you're a duelist, right?

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:15.370
I also duel.  Will you duel me?

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:18.400
I always have to duel against 
Luca, so it's boring.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.160
How rude.  You're weak too, Lua.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.220
I'm going to start getting more powerful!

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:26.550
Yusei, are you powerful?

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:38.180
That's my treasure.  They're 
the King's merchandise.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:41.270
It's my dream to someday become the King.

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.370
I also want to do Riding Duels!

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:47.020
You can do that even if you're not the King.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.650
Luca, be quiet for a moment!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:52.250
Do you like the King, Yusei?

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.550
I'm not interested in him.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.030
Oh.  Fine.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.750
But you do Riding Duels.  What a waste.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.240
How did you know that?

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.200
Because that's a D-Wheel, right?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.790
If you're a D-Wheeler, aren't 
you supposed to admire the King?

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.280
He's not listening to you, Lua.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.710
In that case...

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.620
Yusei, look at this!  You might 
be able to duel the King!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.600
Ta-daa!

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:33.630
Duel of Fortune Cup?

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:38.790
Yeah!  Kaiba Corporation randomly selected 
people to participate in a tournament!

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.540
And they chose Luca!

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:45.820
The winning duelist gets to duel the King!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.330
I don't feel like entering.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.230
Hear that?  Luca is always like this.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.050
That's why I'm going to 
pretend to be Luca and enter.

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.490
It's impossible for Lua to impersonate me.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:59.420
It's not impossible!  We have the same face!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.250
Same face?  Which part?

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.710
We're twins!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.440
We're not the same.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.810
Of course not because I'm a 
boy and you're a girl, but…

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.120
Let me handle it.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.520
Lua, you're too happy-go-lucky.

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.730
Even regarding him.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.620
Luca, you don't trust Yusei?

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:21.040
He's a duelist that takes care of 
his cards!  I want to help him!

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.460
Lua, you're talking too loud.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.820
Thanks for hiding me.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:30.880
However, you shouldn't get involved with me.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.540
You're leaving?

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.890
I shouldn't bother you.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.890
You're not bothering us!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.760
Oh yeah!

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:52.050
Yusei, duel me!

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:55.310
If you're a duelist, you 
have to accept challenges!

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:57.810
Lua, aren't you the one who's bothering him?

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:02.670
But Yusei is probably strong!  I 
want to duel against strong people!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:07.600
Let's do it, Yusei!  I want to duel against 
different people to increase my dueling skills!

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:11.890
C'mon, let's do it!  Let's do it!

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.470
Stay on!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:17.170
That was embarrassing.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.440
I'll fix it right away.  Just wait a second.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:23.220
He's similar to Rally.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:25.800
I understand.  Let's do it.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.760
Hooray!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.050
Moment out.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.180
So that's how it works!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.010
Awesome!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.720
Is there anyone else here?

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.140
It's just us on this floor.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.420
This is the very top of the hotel.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:08:00.110
It's just been the two of 
us since a long time ago.

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:05.410
Our parents are away for work, and they only 
come back occasionally.  It's a comfortable life.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:10.030
We can do our homework on the 
internet, so we rarely go outside.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:11.310
I see.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.160
All right.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:14.580
Now it's fine.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.590
You're right!  Thank you, Yusei!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.520
Don't worry about it.  Let's start.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.430
You can have the first turn.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.540
My deck is pretty incredible.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.610
Start anytime you like.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.820
Here I go.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:37.860
Duel!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.750
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.140
I already got it!

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:47.510
I summon Morphtronic Celfon!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.860
In attack position!

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.100
It's so cool!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.470
The monster effects of 
Morphtronic monsters change

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.910
depending on whether they're 
in attack or defense position.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.910
When Celfon is in attack position,

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:14.080
it dials a number between 1 and 6, 
and I flip over that many cards.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:18.980
If that card is a Level 4-or-below 
Morphtronic monster, then I can Special Summon it.

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:23.420
Here I go!  Dial...

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.230
It's a bit heavy.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.400
Lua's duels are loud.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:36.310
Luca, stop saying unnecessary things.  
It's a crucial moment right now!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.460
Dial on!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.680
It stopped on three!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.570
I flip over three cards!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.910
All right!  The card I 
flipped over is Level 3!

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:54.660
I Special Summon Morphtronic Magnen!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.310
In attack position!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.290
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:15.030
How are my monsters?  Aren't they cool?

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.350
He's more excited than usual.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.690
It's my turn.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.330
I summon Speed Warrior.

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:30.650
On the turn that Speed Warrior is 
summoned, its attack points are doubled.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:31.990
Doubled?

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.240
Battle.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.750
I was waiting for that!  I activate 
the trap card Morphtransition!

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.740
Sonic Edge!

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:47.420
How's that?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.360
With this trap, the Morphtronic 
monster that was attacked

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.860
changes battle position, 
and the battle is negated!

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:55.490
That's an interesting trap you're using.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:59.760
Right?  I wanted to show 
you that it transforms!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.670
It's too early to get cocky.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.750
Well, watch!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.880
Yusei, are you ending your turn?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:06.970
Yes.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.560
All right!  My turn.  I draw!

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.700
That's what you get for showing off.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.010
Be quiet.

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:18.340
From my hand, I summon my 
second Morphtronic Magnen!

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.080
This time in defense position!

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.420
Isn't it impressive?

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:39.390
When Magnen is in defense position, you're 
not allowed to attack any monster except Magnen.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:42.730
However, there are two Magnens on my field!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.170
That means…

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:50.060
He's talking more than usual today.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:11.290
You guys guard the west gate.  
Don't let that punk escape.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.390
Right.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:18.290
Security is covering every area.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.160
What will you do, Yusei?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.880
Listen carefully.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:30.990
If you try to attack the first Magnen, then 
the second Magnen will try to take the attack.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:36.580
And if you try to attack the second Magnen, 
then the first one will try to take the attack.

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:40.940
In other words, it means that 
you can't attack, Yusei!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.560
This is Magnelock, the 
impenetrable defense formation!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.590
So things are going perfectly.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.620
I'm going to use Celfon's monster effect!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.980
Dial on!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:13:03.750
A two appeared!  The second card is another 
Level 4-or-below Morphtronic monster.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:07.900
I Special Summon Morphtronic 
Datatron in attack position!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.150
I'm only getting started!

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.790
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell Gadget Box!

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:27.510
With this card, I can Special Summon 
one Gadget Token once per turn!

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.940
Here I go!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:32.300
I Special Summon Gadget Token!

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:36.970
He brought out a support part 
with 0 attack and defense points.

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:40.740
I've gather all the parts!  Here 
comes Datatron's monster effect!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:48.440
By releasing one monster on the field, 
Datatron deals 600 points of damage.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:51.040
I release Gadget Token!

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.590
Here I go!  Chakan Fire!

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:03.030
Gadget Token's purpose was for this monster.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.810
I did it!  The combo worked!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:08.900
I'm still unhurt!  It feels really good!

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:13.630
Isn't this incredible?  I call 
it my special Morphtronic Deck!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.910
Whatever you say, but isn't 
it the end of your turn?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.730
Oh yeah.  End end end.  You're up, Yusei!

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:25.100
What is the progress on the Fortune Cup?

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.390
The invitations were sent without delay.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.890
Only one remains.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.600
For the boy from Satellite?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.260
That's correct.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:44.080
He retrieved his D-Wheel and deck from the 
vault, and he's currently hiding in the Tops.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.100
How about the marker signal?

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.050
There's no error.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:53.250
He thinks that he disabled it, 
but it was amateurish work.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.490
It's my turn.

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:06.410
I send one card in my hand to the graveyard 
to activate the spell card Card Rotator.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:08.600
What?

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:14.570
This card changes the battle position 
of all the monsters on your field.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.090
All?

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:28.580
After all the work I did to 
assemble my Morphtronic army!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.670
Now their monster effects will change!

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.260
Hold it together, Lua!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.260
The duel isn't over yet!

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.530
But!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.900
Furthermore…

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:40.540
I summon the Tuner Monster Junk Synchron.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.780
The counterattack is going to begin.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.700
With Junk Synchron's monster 
effect, I can Special Summon

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:49.840
a Level 2-or-below monster from 
my graveyard in defense position.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:53.780
I Special Summon Nitro 
Synchron in defense position.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.780
That means you're going to Synchro 
Summon a Level 7 monster?

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:58.770
That's not possible.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:15:59.700
Why?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:03.030
Level 3, Level 2, Level 2...

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:07.250
If you add them together, he can 
summon a Level 7 Synchro Monster!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:11.430
In order to Synchro Summon, 
I can only use one Tuner.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.480
Junk Synchron and Nitro Synchron 
are both Tuner Monsters.

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:18.570
Here I go.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:23.180
Junk Synchron tunes Level 2 Speed Warrior.

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:32.690
It's cool…

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:38.600
Next, Level 2 Nitro Synchron 
tunes Level 5 Junk Warrior.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:48.670
Our thoughts combine to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:50.290
Synchro Summon!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.980
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:59.610
This makes me excited!  Two 
Synchro Summons in a row!

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.870
Awesome!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:02.970
Here I go!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:07.810
Battle!  Nitro Warrior, attack Magnen.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.210
Magnen!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:16.290
Next is Nitro Warrior's monster effect.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:21.110
When it destroys a monster in battle, it 
can switch one monster in defense position

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:25.010
to attack position and battle 
against that monster.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:28.460
Celfon switches from defense 
position to attack position.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.800
Dynamite Impact!

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:35.540
No way!

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:38.600
Nitro Warrior, attack Celfon.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.910
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.070
You always cry.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.490
I'm not crying!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.940
Your love of dueling has touched me.

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:04.360
However, your dueling is 
a bit too self-centered.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:09.380
Weren't you satisfied when you gathered 
the four Morphtronic monsters?

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:14.590
Morphtronic monsters change their monster 
effects depending on the situation.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:19.190
However, you're also able to change 
that situation during a duel.

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:24.150
If you can't anticipate my counterattacks 
and keep dueling in a self-centered manner,

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:26.370
the road to becoming King 
will remain far away.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:31.240
Well, cheer up.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.980
Yusei…

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.300
Will you duel me again?

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:38.760
In time.  Thanks for your hospitality.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.400
You can't leave!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:45.720
Look at this marker.  If I stay 
with you, I'll cause you trouble.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:50.090
Why?  I want to help you.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:53.710
There he goes again.  Lua 
always wants to help people.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.200
But...

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:58.690
But shouldn't you at least rest for today?

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:18.040
Hurry up and come out, you punk.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.740
I was waiting for you, punk!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:14.300
He got to him before me.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.740
Now why don't you give up!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:19.820
I won't let you escape!

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:21.550
What?

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.070
That mark!

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:37.690
Investigator, will you please let the Public 
Maintenance Department deal with him?

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.880
Public Maintenance Department?

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:46.730
I'm Jaeger, Head of Special 
Investigations.  Aren't you Ushio?

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.540
Head of Special Investigations?

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:56.390
I have a message for him 
from Director Rex Godwin.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:59.800
But he stole that D-Wheel 
from the security vault!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:06.080
Ushio, I don't think you should disobey 
the director's orders, do you?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.850
What does the director want with me?

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.940
This.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.320
Please participate in 
the Duel of Fortune Cup.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:26.590
If you don't, the four people in the photo 
will suffer pain that you can't even imagine.

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.220
Okay?

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:09.500
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:14.890
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:20.810
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.970 --> 00:22:26.050
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:29.210
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:34.800
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:41.960
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:47.360
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:53.300
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:58.640
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:04.730
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:14.150
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
